WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
Three French words: «ses», «ces»,

2
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.160
«c'est». Listen closely.

3
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.820
Can you tell them apart?

4
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.620
Now «tout», «vous», «grand».

5
00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:12.600
Each one ends in a letter nobody says.

6
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.260
On paper, it still has to be there.

7
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.450
A voice reads you a French sentence.

8
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.470
You write it down exactly.

9
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:23.640
No dictionary. So how do you write
down French you've only heard,

10
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.360
when so many letters make no sound?

11
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.910
In this mission, you'll
find out what each hearing

12
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.580
of a sentence is for.

13
00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.720
Then you'll sort words by
ear into spelling bins,

14
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.480
and finish two lines
by picking the endings.

15
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.100
Your mission: crack the silent letters,

16
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.090
and write exactly what you hear.
